extends ../partials/_template.pug

block content
    h1 
        | 👋 Hi! I'm Cailey Miller.
    h2(style="font-size: 1.5em; color: #a2c11c;") 
        | I'm a senior front end focused software engineer, technical lead, and web accessibility specialist with 6+ years of professional experience.
    p(id="blurb-specific")
        | The bulk of my experience has been spent wearing many hats in fast paced, high autonomy environments - including early stage startups. 
        | I am experienced in prototyping and developing greenfield applications from scratch, as well as maintaining and modernizing legacy systems. 
        | I have a natural eye for UI/UX design, and recently served as the primary in-house design authority for internal systems at 
        a(href="https://fieldtech.ai/") Fieldtech.
        br
        br
        | 🥞 Though I've historically been front end focused, I am full stack curious and happy to work across the stack.
        br
        br
    div(style="background: rgb(72, 104, 107, .2); padding: 1em;")
        h3(style="margin-top: 0;") Skills, Tools, and Tech:
        div
            p ⭐ #[span(style="font-weight: bold;") Languages:] JavaScript, TypeScript, Node, jQuery, GraphQL, HTML5, CSS/SASS, C#&nbsp;(familiarity), SQL&nbsp;(familiarity)
            p ⭐ #[span(style="font-weight: bold;") Frameworks and Libraries]: React, Redux, Apollo, Tanstack Query, Material&nbsp;UI, React&nbsp;Aria, React&nbsp;Hook&nbsp;Form, Yup, Zod, Svelte&nbsp;(Familiarity), Next.js&nbsp;(Familiarity), .NET&nbsp;(Familiarity)
            p ⭐ #[span(style="font-weight: bold;") Testing]: Jest, Vitest, React&nbsp;Testing&nbsp;Library, Cypress, Playwright, axe-core, Axe&nbsp;Devtools, JAWs, Voiceover, Enzyme, BrowserStack, MSW
            p ⭐ #[span(style="font-weight: bold;") Infrastructure and Tools]: Storybook, Nx, Vite, Git, CI/CD&nbsp;(Azure, GitHub Actions), PWA&nbsp;(Progressive Web Apps),
                |  Firebase, Copilot, Claude&nbsp;Code, AI, Figma, Jira
            p ⭐ #[span(style="font-weight: bold;") General]: Web&nbsp;Accessibility&nbsp;(WCAG 2.1 AA+), UI/UX&nbsp;Design, Software Testing&nbsp;/&nbsp;QA, Mentorship,
                |  Technical&nbsp;Writing, People&nbsp;Management, Agile
